    <parallel-reason>Modifies ProvisionProjectEndpoint.cs, which six other register tasks also edit: 144 (C10 part 1 — rewrites Step 3, generalizes roots; hard dep), 139 (C4 — CreatorAccessRights / CollaboratorAccessRights values and the :158-181 rationale), 143 (No Access guard on the creator/colleague share sites :726/:754), 148 (backfill at provision), 149 (sharee sync from the provisioning shares) and 150 (sprk_issecure set as provisioning's FIRST mutation). Also edits the shared provisioning test fixture, provisioningService.ts (also edited by 150) and CreateProjectWizard.tsx (also edited by 150). Sequencing: 144 → 133, then 148/149 (which already dep on 146) build on 133's resume/ensure structure; 139, 143 and 150 may land on either side of 133 — whichever lands second rebases and re-runs ProvisionProjectIdempotencyTests + SecureProjectShareTests + provisioningService.test.ts.</parallel-reason>
